sequenceDiagram
  participant MD as market_data
  participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
  participant IC as intel cache
  participant M as model
  participant RG as risk governor
  participant MK as maker
  participant BK as book
  MD->>RMQ: ticks (4/s, all prices)
  MD->>RMQ: market.depth (per symbol, 1/s)
  SIG->>RMQ: intel.signal + intel.flow (10s)
  RMQ-->>IC: subscribe (queue per topic)
  M->>IC: get(symbol)
  IC-->>M: score, flow_conf, ta, forecast
  M->>RG: allow(sym, side, notional, ages)
  alt refused
    RG-->>M: reason (stale, cost, cap)
    M->>RMQ: model.decision refused
  else allowed
    RG-->>M: allowed
    M->>MK: quote(sym, side, notional)
    MK-->>M: price, fill probability
    M->>BK: open position
    M->>RMQ: model.decision allowed
  end
  BK->>RMQ: model.fill on close
